hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"975","Bundar told us, Yahya told us, on the authority of Shu’bah, on the authority of Hamza al-Dhabi, on the authority of Anas ibn Malik, that the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, was “ If he stays at a certain place, he does not move on until he has prayed the noon prayer.” I said: Even if it is midday? He said: Even if it is in the middle of the day"
